-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Heiderhoff</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Szecsenyi</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>How can the practice nurse be more involved in the care of the chronically ill? The perspectives of GPs, patients and practice nurses</article-title><source>BMC Family Practice</source><year>2006</year><month>3</month><day>3</day><volume>7</volume><fpage>14</fpage><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.biomedcentral.com/1471-2296/7/14">http://www.biomedcentral.com/1471-2296/7/14</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16515692</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="r8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><article-title>Sachverst&#x000e4;ndigenrat zur Begutachtung der Entwicklung im Gesundheitswesen</article-title><trans-title>Advisory Council on the Assessment of Developments in the Health Care System</trans-title><source>Appropriateness and efficiency. Report 2000&#x02013;2001 Summary</source><year>2001</year><publisher-loc>Bonn</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Advisory Council on the Assessment of Developments in the Health Care System</publisher-name><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.svr-gesundheit.de">http://www.svr-gesundheit.de</ext-link></comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="r9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><article-title>Sachverst&#x000e4;ndigenrat zur Begutachtung der Entwicklung im Gesundheitswesen</article-title><trans-title>Advisory Council on the Assessment of Developments in the Health Care System</trans-title><source>Health care finance, user orientation and quality. Report 2003 Summary</source><year>2003</year><publisher-loc>Bonn</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Advisory Council on the Assessment of Developments in the Health Care System</publisher-name><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink: